[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307168763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110376#issuecomment-3307168763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110376","id":3307168763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FH2P7","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T12:23:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T12:23:57Z","body":"However, if you look closely at the feet and ground in the animation after keying, you can see a difference between IK animation and keyed animation.\r\n\r\nThis occurs because even if the interpolation between IK animation keys is linear, the actual bone transforms do not become linear.\r\n\r\nTo deal with this, we need to bake the bone transforms per frame. However, since the workflow depends on the structure of individual projects, so I believe this should be an Addon rather than core support.\r\n\r\nI have already tested that this is doable, so I can publish the Addon to awesome-godot or assetlib later.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1490\" height=\"830\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30676941-9366-46d4-a36a-64fcf8b07594\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307168763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3558718228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110376#issuecomment-3558718228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110376","id":3558718228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UHbsU","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T15:38:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T15:39:41Z","body":"During the animation meeting, @lyuma's feedback pointed out that the toggle button makes it difficult to recognize that this is a modifier related function.\r\n\r\nTherefore, instead of a toggle, I added two buttons for modifiers to make them clear at a glance.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"624\" height=\"227\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/554cc971-ee25-41dd-94eb-b574b8cbea8a\" />\r\n\r\nWhile labeling them \"IK\" isn't strictly accurate since they relate to the whole modifier, but it's clear enough given the use case. This is also @lyuma's idea.\r\n\r\nI also slightly modified the original bone key buttons to make it clearer they are for keying.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3558718228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3564838294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110376#issuecomment-3564838294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110376","id":3564838294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uex2W","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11